ew</span></h2>
<span data-as=3D"p">Memory is a system that remembers information about pre=
vious interactions. For AI agents, memory is crucial because it lets them r=
emember previous interactions, learn from feedback, and adapt to user prefe=
rences. As agents tackle more complex tasks with numerous user interactions=
, this capability becomes essential for both efficiency and user satisfacti=
on.</span>
<span data-as=3D"p">Short term memory lets your application remember previo=
us interactions within a single thread or conversation.</span>
<div class=3D"callout my-4 px-5 py-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl flex gap-3=
 border border-sky-500/20 bg-sky-50/50 dark:border-sky-500/30 dark:bg-sky-5=
00/10" data-callout-type=3D"note"><div class=3D"mt-0.5 w-4" data-component-=
part=3D"callout-icon"><svg width=3D"14" height=3D"14" viewBox=3D"0 0 14 14"=
