oreferrer" class=3D"link"><code>add_messages</code></a> <a class=3D"link" h=
ref=3D"https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langgraph/graph-api#reducers">=
reducer</a>.</span>
<span data-as=3D"p">The default <a href=3D"https://reference.langchain.com/=
python/langchain/agents/#langchain.agents.AgentState" target=3D"_blank" rel=
=3D"noreferrer" class=3D"link"><code>AgentState</code></a> provides this.</=
